<title>USA: RailAmerica has new $40 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>RailAmerica has new $40 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>RailAmerica Inc said Tuesday it had closed on a new $40 million three-year revolving credit facility with National Bank of Canada and Comerica Bank.</p>
<p>Previously the company had a $25 million revolving line of credit with National Bank of Canada.</p>
<p>RailAmerica said it intends to use the increased funds for rail acquisitions and working capital.</p>
</text>
